# Windows 10 Endpoint Deployment

## Overview

Windows 10 serves as the primary monitored endpoint within the SOC lab.

This virtual machine hosts:

- Splunk Enterprise
- Splunk Universal Forwarder
- Sysmon

The machine will later become a domain-joined workstation managed through Active Directory.

